{"id":"f276735320c6ad44","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-fixed-point-model.md","title":"由跳跃固定点诱导的真理模型","display":"df-fixed-point-model — 由跳跃固定点诱导的真理模型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-fixed-point-model","aliases":["91-df-fixed-point-model","91-df-Kripke-model"],"display":"df-fixed-point-model — 由跳跃固定点诱导的真理模型","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-fixed-point-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-fixed-point-model</span><span>91-df-Kripke-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-point-model — 由跳跃固定点诱导的真理模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-fixed-point-model-—-由跳跃固定点诱导的真理模型-$\\mathfrak-M_\\Gamma$\">df-fixed-point-model — 由跳跃固定点诱导的真理模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathfrak M_\\Gamma\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> (标准自然数结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (给定的强 Kleene 真理跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (句子编码的信息集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> (不同时接受句子及其否定的信息一致性)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vDash_3\">\\(\\vDash_3\\)</span> (由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma\">\\(v_\\Gamma\\)</span> 诱导、以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\)</span> 为指定值的满足关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak M_\\Gamma\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma)\n\\qquad\n(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\land J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak M_\\Gamma\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma)\n\\qquad\n(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\land J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak M_\\Gamma\\vDash_3 T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak M_\\Gamma\\vDash_3 T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=X_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma=X_{\\min}\\)</span>，得到极小固定点模型\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{\\min}\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{\\min}\\)</span>。它由从空信息开始的超穷迭代在首次闭包序数\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 处获得：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}=\\Gamma_\\kappa,\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha),\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\alpha.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_{\\min}=\\Gamma_\\kappa,\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha),\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\alpha.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一般不能用有限阶段的并 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}\\Gamma_n\">\\(\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}\\Gamma_n\\)</span> 代替该超穷闭包。</p>\n<p>固定点只给出部分信息：若\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\\)</span> 且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\">\\(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在诱导的\n强 Kleene 评估中未定义。不能写成“既不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 也不在其集合补集”。\n正性保证相关算子单调，不保证每个正公式在所有固定点中二值确定；\n真理陈述者提供直接反例。</p>\n<p>标准一致固定点验证相应 KF 真理条件，因而在足够可靠的元理论中提供\nKF 的相对一致性模型。该结论依赖具体 KF 版本、跳跃定义与元理论，\n不应概括成固定点模型无条件证明 KF 的全部“可靠性”，也不表示 KF\n的一阶公理唯一选定极小固定点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-fixed-point-model-—-由跳跃固定点诱导的真理模型-$\\mathfrak-M_\\Gamma$","text":"df-fixed-point-model — 由跳跃固定点诱导的真理模型 $\\mathfrak M_\\Gamma$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vDash_3","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak M_\\Gamma\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma)\n\\qquad\n(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\land J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak M_\\Gamma\\vDash_3 T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma=X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\min}=\\Gamma_\\kappa,\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha),\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha<\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\alpha.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{n<\\omega}\\Gamma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":2286,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d8969c7b834f5a6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10229cf1ace7edd3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}$ (相应固定点模型, see [[91-df-fixed-point-model]])"},{"id":"7f5043d4200f56d1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"则$\\mathfrak{M}_0[\\Gamma]$是相应固定点模型\n（见[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]）。"},{"id":"8adbccc4211045f3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cb582ee79087af80","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d12ffdb5e1b32a31","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-d